CATEGORIES:Legendary Pictures
DESCRIPTION:Nearly two decades after he seized control of the Imperium\, P
 aul Atreides is now a ruthless Emperor\, and must face the consequences o
 f his reign as old allies return\, terrifying new threats emerge\, and be
 trayal lurks in every shadow. Haunted by visions of Imperial collapse and
  the reappearance of his long-lost love\, Paul is drawn into a sweeping c
 onspiracy\, with Chani at the heart of its unfolding mystery. As enemies 
 close in\, Paul must confront the true cost of power and the fate of thos
 e he loves the most.
